    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0010-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:28:16.46+09:00">In A Compendius (sic) Essay,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:29:31.828+09:00">it links cracks </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:29:41.089+09:00">and fills openings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:29:49.147+09:00">turns crooked paths into straight roads</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:29:58.136+09:00">to study the original state of the myriad things,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:30:11.242+09:00">and thus to foresee the alteration of gain and loss,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:30:59.997+09:00">advantages and disadvantages.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:31:18.844+09:00">So a man will not be overwhelmed with power</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:31:38.712+09:00">or lured by complicated affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:32:00.219+09:00">Therefore he can not only comply with the Tao of Heaven</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:32:23.327+09:00">but also penetrate the development of situations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_021-14a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-06T23:32:44.729+09:00">and thus adapt to the act of the Creator.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
